    "Der Standardlauf ist bei neuen Einträgen vorausgewählt.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The default barrel is preselected for new entries."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le canon par défaut est présélectionné pour les nouvelles entrées."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La canna predefinita è preselezionata per le nuove voci."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Datei konnte nicht gelesen werden. Erwartet wird ShootCounter-Export.tsv oder data.db.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The file could not be read. Expected ShootCounter-Export.tsv or data.db."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le fichier n'a pas pu être lu. Fichier attendu : ShootCounter-Export.tsv ou data.db."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Impossibile leggere il file. Previsto: ShootCounter-Export.tsv o data.db."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Kaliber gehören zum Lauf. Beim Erfassen werden nur die Kaliber der montierten Läufe angeboten.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calibres belong to the barrel. New entries only offer the calibres of the fitted barrels."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les calibres appartiennent au canon. Les entrées ne proposent que les calibres des canons montés."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I calibri appartengono alla canna. Le voci propongono solo i calibri delle canne montate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Lizenznummer hat höchstens 6 Ziffern.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The licence number has at most 6 digits."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le numéro de licence comporte au plus 6 chiffres."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il numero di licenza ha al massimo 6 cifre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die alte App hat nur Verweise auf %lld Fotos in deiner Mediathek gespeichert. Sie werden gefunden, wenn die Fotos noch auf diesem Gerät oder in iCloud-Fotos sind.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The old app only stored references to %lld photos in your library. They are found if the photos are still on this device or in iCloud Photos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'ancienne app n'a enregistré que des références vers %lld photos de votre photothèque. Elles sont retrouvées si les photos sont encore sur cet appareil ou dans Photos iCloud."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La vecchia app ha salvato solo riferimenti a %lld foto della tua libreria. Vengono trovate se le foto sono ancora su questo dispositivo o in Foto di iCloud."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die alte App kannte keine Kaliber. Jede Munition wird einem Kaliber zugeordnet; daraus ergeben sich die Kaliber deiner Sportgeräte.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The old app had no calibres. Each ammunition is assigned a calibre, which also sets the calibres of your equipment."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'ancienne app ne connaissait pas les calibres. Chaque munition est attribuée à un calibre ; on en déduit les calibres de tes équipements."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La vecchia app non conosceva i calibri. Ogni munizione viene assegnata a un calibro; da qui risultano i calibri dei tuoi attrezzi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die alte App kannte keine Kaliber. Jede Munition wird einem Kaliber zugeordnet; daraus ergeben sich die Kaliber deiner Waffen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The old app had no calibres. Each ammunition is assigned a calibre, which also sets the calibres of your firearms."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'ancienne app ne connaissait pas les calibres. Chaque munition est associée à un calibre, ce qui définit aussi les calibres de vos armes."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La vecchia app non conosceva i calibri. A ogni munizione viene assegnato un calibro, che determina anche i calibri delle tue armi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die alte App kannte nur die Gesamtzahl der Schüsse. Ein Stich hat meist 10, 15–18, 20, 30 oder 60 Schüsse; was darüber liegt, wird als Probeschüsse erfasst. Schalte Einträge aus, bei denen das nicht stimmt.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The old app only knew the total number of shots. A match usually has 10, 15–18, 20, 30 or 60 shots; anything above that is recorded as sighters. Switch off entries where this is wrong."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'ancienne app ne connaissait que le nombre total de coups. Une cible compte généralement 10, 15–18, 20, 30 ou 60 coups ; le surplus est enregistré comme coups d'essai. Désactive les entrées pour lesquelles ce n'est pas juste."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La vecchia app conosceva solo il numero totale di colpi. Un bersaglio ha di solito 10, 15–18, 20, 30 o 60 colpi; quelli in più vengono registrati come colpi di prova. Disattiva le voci per cui non è corretto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diese Patronen haben dieselben Masse. Prüfe die Angaben des Herstellers, bevor du sie im selben Lauf verschiesst.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These cartridges have the same dimensions. Check the manufacturer's specifications before firing them in the same barrel."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ces cartouches ont les mêmes dimensions. Vérifie les indications du fabricant avant de les tirer dans le même canon."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Queste cartucce hanno le stesse dimensioni. Verifica le indicazioni del produttore prima di spararle nella stessa canna."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diesen Namen gibt es schon.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This name already exists."
